Derived files and their upstream sources
----------------------------------------

  src/aleph_belief/trust.py   <- src/ontology-patch.ts  (OntologyNodeTrustTier,
                                 violatesTrustTier)
  src/aleph_belief/patch.py   <- src/ontology-patch.ts  (ONTOLOGY_PATCH_SCHEMA,
                                 OntologyPatchOperation, OntologyPatchStatus,
                                 OntologyPatch, OntologyPatchIssue,
                                 OntologyPatchValidationResult)
  src/aleph_belief/reconcile.py <- src/entity-linking.ts (candidate scoring on
                                 shared normalized terms) and
                                 differentEntityReason (named reject reasons
                                 instead of a bare threshold)

The ports are adaptations, not transliterations: naming follows Aleph's belief
domain, the models are Pydantic, and validation is split into an envelope-only
pure pass here versus graph-precondition checks at apply time.
